  <h2>Antwerp — After thorough analysis, an exclusive partnership is born</h2>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">After a thorough analysis of the bakery industry in the Benelux countries, detailed discussions with the various players in the industry and an extensive selection of potential providers for bakery ovens, proofers and automation, Pinso Benelux has decided to set up an exclusive collaboration with Kornfeil.</p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">KORNFEIL has been known for many years as a manufacturer of high quality bakery ovens, proofers and automation for the artisanal, semi-industrial and industrial bakery. Their product range consists of:</p>

  <h5>Thermical Cyclo Therm Ovens</h5>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">Starting from 8 m² and up to 31 m² baking surface with one or more temperatures. This oven is perfect for the baker who wants to bake products directly on the stone floor. Automated loading and unloading equipment is also available to reduce handling within your company.</p>

  <h5>Thermical Oil Ovens</h5>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">Available in different versions — as a deck oven or a rack oven. These ovens can be supplied with multiple temperatures, even with one temperature zone per floor. Centrally heated thermal oil is circulated through a tube circuit; three-way valves provide flexible setting of the desired temperature per oven tunnel. One central heater can control up to 5 oven tunnels. These modular oven systems can be expanded as needed.</p>

  <h5>Tunnel Ovens / Band Ovens</h5>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">Continuous ovens for the industrial bakery. Available in electrically heated, cyclo-thermical or thermical oil versions. Pinso Benelux is happy to work out a customized proposal for you.</p>

  <h5>Energy Saving Systems</h5>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">The KORNFEIL EKOBLOK is widely known and renowned for its high energy efficiency, easy to install and use within any type of bakery. Kornfeil has been active in the field of rational energy use for many years, offering solutions for heat recovery and more efficient use of energy within your bakery.</p>

  <h5>Handling Systems</h5>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">The cost of labor is increasing every year. Thanks to Kornfeil's experience in the artisanal, semi-industrial and industrial bakery, they can offer a suitable and cost-effective solution for almost all your handling problems.</p>

